<<
/Title (Coral reefs are biodiversity rich ecosystems that are increasingly affected by bleaching, disease and other environmental stresses. Monitoring reef condition through underwater surveys and image analysis is often labour intensive. AI and computer vision provide an opportunity to automate the analysis of underwater imagery and derive quantitative reef health indicators. This project investigates a trustworthy AI assisted framework for coral reef health assessment and temporal change detection using ROV imagery from Lakshadweep)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 428 0 R
>>
endobj
